  "description": "BUILT TO FLY. BRED TO FIGHT.\n\nThe LINEFINDER LTD is down-country perfection — a carbon 120mm frame with FOX Float X Factory rear shock and FOX 34 Factory FIT4 130mm fork for precision on every trail.\nA full Shimano XT 12-speed drivetrain and XT M8120 brakes with 180mm rotors deliver flawless shifting and stopping power. Boyd Stumphouse wheels with Vittoria Syerra 29x2.4 tires keep you fast and planted.\nWith a ProTaper Stealth cockpit, FOX Transfer dropper, and Selle Model X Superflow saddle, it’s built for speed, comfort, and control — all in one.\n\nBIKE SPECS:\n\nFRAME\n\nLINEFINDER CARBON 120MM\n\nREAR SHOCK\n\nFOX FLOAT X FACTORY\n\nFORK\n\nFOX 34 FACTORY FIT4 130MM\n\nHANDLEBAR\n\nPRO TAPER STEALTH 800X1\"\n\nSTEM\n\nPRO TAPER STEALTH 45X35MM\n\nSEATPOST\n\nFOX TRANSFER 175MM\n\nSADDLE\n\nSELLE MODEL X SUPERFLOW\n\nGRIPS\n\nPRO TAPER\n\nSHIFTER\n\nSHIMANO XT 12SPD\n\nREAR DERAILLEUR\n\nSHIMANO XT 12SPD\n\nCRANKSET\n\nSHIMANO XT 12SPD\n\nCASSETTE\n\nSHIMANO XT 12SPD 10-51\n\nCHAIN\n\nSHIMANO HG 12SPD\n\nBRAKES\n\nSHIMANO XT M8120\n\nBRAKE ROTORS\n\nSHIMANO 180MM CL\n\nWHEELSET\n\nBOYD STUMPHOUSE\n\nFRONT TIRE\n\nVITTORIA SYERRA 29X2.4\n\nREAR TIRE\n\nVITTORIA SYERRA 29X2.4\n\nHEADSET\n\nFSA NO.55R 1.5\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\nWHEELS MFG T47",
